   if a.lastName < b.lastName -> a comes first
   if a.lastName > b.lastName -> b comes first
   if equal, compare by firstName.

 We can write a comparison function that returns a negative number, zero, or positive number.

 But since we are implementing merge sort, we can do the comparison directly in the merge step.

